            <p>Building a NOM home without hassle</p>
            <p>Installing and connecting E and W installations in a NOM home is complex and labour-intensive. These installations have already been connected and integrated in an energy module, which provides installation efficiency. Each module is equipped with a smart energy management system (SEM), which is guaranteed to install a working device. The SEM monitors energy consumption and production, and the module is installed within four hours. As a result, the NOM home is a highly efficient and sustainable home. The resident in question suffers as little nuisance as possible. The SEM is a smart energy management module (SEM), which monitors, visualises and stores data in the cloud. This means that the house is also ready to take part in the energy market of the future and that the resident can react well, for example, if energy prices are low due to a lot of wind at sea.</p>
